                        "form": "die Kaleidoskope"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "8153cc8e-9e07-3acf-b539-b7951c09c865",
                        "entry_id": "a54f1bdc-bea6-3c5b-bf2d-c3c9db85bda0",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Spielzeug aus einer mit Spiegeln versehenen Röhre, das beim Durchschauen und Drehen verschiedenste symmetrische Muster erzeugt"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "ad0bb5f2-8016-4902-9555-b61eb41b26e8",
                                "sense_id": "8153cc8e-9e07-3acf-b539-b7951c09c865",
                                "text": "Das größte Kaleidoskop der Erde steht in Japan."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "efea8613-5cee-482f-9c11-1d36f4e24966",
                                "sense_id": "8153cc8e-9e07-3acf-b539-b7951c09c865",
                                "text": "„Jemand hätte der Kahlo ein Kaleidoskop schenken sollen.“"
                            }
                        ],
                        "sense_index_json": "\"1\""
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "9cd57d30-ea49-352d-93ef-dcc64126c22d",
                        "entry_id": "a54f1bdc-bea6-3c5b-bf2d-c3c9db85bda0",
                        "glosses": [
                            "bunte Mischung, Allerlei"
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "figurative"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "4920f83a-9919-48ec-a1c8-a758e06d3c18",
                                "sense_id": "9cd57d30-ea49-352d-93ef-dcc64126c22d",
                                "text": "Die Aufführung war ein Kaleidoskop der modernen Artistik."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "a811668c-046c-4910-ae9b-4b563c403ac5",
                                "sense_id": "9cd57d30-ea49-352d-93ef-dcc64126c22d",
                                "text": "„Im Kaleidoskop ihrer Schilderungen spiegelt sich die Wirrnis einer Zeit, die als »Stunde Null« in der Erinnerung derer gespeichert ist, die sie durchlebt haben.“"
                            }
                        ],
                        "sense_index_json": "\"2\""
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "6fd8793b-854d-43d7-b2ed-1da60fc20ac3",
                        "source_entry_id": "a54f1bdc-bea6-3c5b-bf2d-c3c9db85bda0",
                        "source_sense_id": "8153cc8e-9e07-3acf-b539-b7951c09c865",
                        "target_lang_word": "kaleidoscope",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "kaleidoscope",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "8603d6b1-6aab-3b69-afc3-815cf3dfb8bf",
                                        "entry_id": "fcbeff4f-08c3-3126-94ef-bd4b66fe81b5",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "An instrument consisting of a tube containing mirrors and loose, colourful beads or other objects; when the tube is looked into and rotated, a succession of symmetrical designs can be seen."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "abf388f7-5fc2-43dc-a9cf-8db3323ebae9",
                                                "sense_id": "8603d6b1-6aab-3b69-afc3-815cf3dfb8bf",
                                                "text": "The Kaleidoscope (from καλος beautiful, ειδος a form, and σκοπεω to see) is an instrument for creating and exhibiting an infinite variety of beautiful forms, and is constructed in such a manner as either to please the eye, by an ever-varying succession of splendid tints and symmetrical forms, or to enable the observer to render permanent such as may appear most appropriate for any of the numerous branches of the ornamental arts."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "495ee817-43a7-4a5e-858d-8f43e5459989",
                                                "sense_id": "8603d6b1-6aab-3b69-afc3-815cf3dfb8bf",
                                                "text": "The mind of Petrarch was like a kaleidoscope. At every turn it presents us with new forms, always fantastic, occasionally beautiful; and we can scarcely believe that all these varieties have been produced by the same worthless fragments of glass."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "da5d1545-be97-47a0-a19a-4cbafd71e0aa",
                                                "sense_id": "8603d6b1-6aab-3b69-afc3-815cf3dfb8bf",
                                                "text": "Detractors saw the kaleidoscope as an expression of a mass consumer culture that could be all too easily distracted by the shiniest new baubles and sensations. […] The revolution that Steve Jobs triggered in 2007 with the launch of the iPhone means that most of us now have a modern day kaleidoscope in our pockets."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "b2281575-2d5e-343c-a689-797b32600ddf",
                                        "entry_id": "fcbeff4f-08c3-3126-94ef-bd4b66fe81b5",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A constantly changing series of colours or other things."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "figuratively"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "dca4af93-32ad-4d76-b39f-812df6ea224d",
                                                "sense_id": "b2281575-2d5e-343c-a689-797b32600ddf",
                                                "text": "[T]his rainbow look'd like hope— / Quite a celestial kaleidoscope."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "9b475744-2150-4ba4-92bf-44575f8df3f5",
                                                "sense_id": "b2281575-2d5e-343c-a689-797b32600ddf",
                                                "text": "Lady Etheringhame being now a constitutionalist, dined rather early: and Emily, her head like a kaleidescope, full of colours, with not a little disdain, put on the blue silk she had thought bleu céleste, at least in the country."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "cea7a7ab-f98e-4e77-9095-f403f8eb0a97",
                                                "sense_id": "b2281575-2d5e-343c-a689-797b32600ddf",
                                                "text": "The rail journey from The Hook [i.e., the Hook of Holland] to Basle is a scenic kaleidoscope, ranging from the flat terrain of the Netherlands to the high ranges of the Black Forest, from the straight Dutch waterways to the sinuous Rhine gorge, from the ocean-going shipping of canals to the busy inland traffic of the Rhine and from peaceful farmland to thriving centres of commerce."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "b1297b61-dcc2-4513-9eec-1ce209e30e71",
                                                "sense_id": "b2281575-2d5e-343c-a689-797b32600ddf",
                                                "text": "Another most notable change concerns rolling stock liveries. Back then, corporate Rail Blue was omnipresent, whereas now there is a kaleidoscope of colours and styles."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "4e80fd5b-d440-45be-b1bf-5300f8446d6e",
                                                "sense_id": "b2281575-2d5e-343c-a689-797b32600ddf",
                                                "text": "The chip smells like nothing, but tastes like a smörgåsbord that's both confusing and arousing, like Steve Buscemi. Flecks of spring green – the kind generated from radioactive waste – coat the unwieldy triangles. The seasoning is a kaleidoscope of Day-Glo dust particles that perishes under saliva and tongue."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "1dc7771c-d921-41f7-8b5a-4916409bc068",
                                                "sense_id": "b2281575-2d5e-343c-a689-797b32600ddf",
                                                "text": "The kaleidoscope of handmade signs and causes, from immigration and the defense of Ukraine to LGBTQ rights and press freedom, spoke to the range and scope of Mr. Trump’s executive actions since Jan. 20."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "b44d631b-49f5-311c-bd7f-f322a06abb78",
                                        "entry_id": "fcbeff4f-08c3-3126-94ef-bd4b66fe81b5",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A swarm of butterflies."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "collective"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "kaleidoscope",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "cee6c389-40fb-3218-8827-711fa70844e5",
                                        "entry_id": "000831ac-19f0-3e00-854a-b47452e40ce4",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To move in shifting (and often attractive or colourful) patterns."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "intransitive"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "133dc445-aa72-4196-99d0-f01bcb01ac08",
                        "source_entry_id": "a54f1bdc-bea6-3c5b-bf2d-c3c9db85bda0",
                        "source_sense_id": "8153cc8e-9e07-3acf-b539-b7951c09c865",
                        "target_lang_word": "kaléidoscope",
                        "target_lang_code": "fr",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "kaléidoscope",
                                "target_lang_code": "fr",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "2727d4cb-a1e0-30a6-b27d-dc812fb99d43",
                                        "entry_id": "272f4f6b-3d89-3cc6-ab43-88eb5a108561",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Ensemble de trois miroirs plans formant une surface prismatique dont la section est un triangle équilatéral dont les faces réfléchissantes sont en regard et qui sont disposés dans un tube cylindrique. Ce tube est fermé d’un coté par un œilleton et de l’autre par un verre dépoli sur lequel sont placés de petits objets brillants et des éclats de verre colorés, produisant, grâce aux miroirs, des effets réguliers et variés utilisés pour rechercher des motifs ornementaux."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "physical"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "8fdb8a05-6538-499b-9545-42e7b0cef717",
                                                "sense_id": "2727d4cb-a1e0-30a6-b27d-dc812fb99d43",
                                                "text": "Ces effets de prisme se modifient à l'infini, suivant la place que l'on occupe. Ne vous semble-t-il pas que nous sommes penchés sur l'ouverture d'un immense kaléidoscope ?"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "3e448cd2-9acb-3c76-be54-2d256698e6fa",
                                        "entry_id": "272f4f6b-3d89-3cc6-ab43-88eb5a108561",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Jouet."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "broadly"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "1e8a499d-c6f1-33c0-a560-a2bb89c3ca7e",
                                        "entry_id": "272f4f6b-3d89-3cc6-ab43-88eb5a108561",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Un autre jeu dont je raffolais, c'est cet instrument de merveilles qu'on appelle kaléidoscope : une sorte de lorgnette qui, dans l'extrémité opposée à celle de l'œil, propose au regard une toujours changeante rosace, formée de mobiles verres de couleur emprisonnés entre deux feuilles transparentes. — (André Gide, Si le grain ne meurt, Gallimard, 1926, 180 pages : lire en ligne)"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "46f89faf-4639-3406-8b71-10ce8d8da020",
                                        "entry_id": "272f4f6b-3d89-3cc6-ab43-88eb5a108561",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Des empilements de conserves bariolaient le fond de la cave, en tas, comme les graviers de couleur d’un kaléidoscope. — (Daniel Boulanger, Le jardin d'Armide, 1969, réédition Le Livre de Poche, 1980, pages 98-98)"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "42be4533-c469-3501-b395-07c0277bd546",
                                        "entry_id": "272f4f6b-3d89-3cc6-ab43-88eb5a108561",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Diversité de choses, de personnes, de couleurs multiples."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "figuratively"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "c814d719-611f-4ca0-aec3-fb006e6252e5",
                                                "sense_id": "42be4533-c469-3501-b395-07c0277bd546",
                                                "text": "L’incrédulité, la satisfaction, l’inquiétude, la fierté, la convoitise déroulèrent leur kaléïdoscope sur les traits de Varichkine."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "72fef18f-e3b9-4c69-a764-15bccbae422e",
                                                "sense_id": "42be4533-c469-3501-b395-07c0277bd546",
                                                "text": "Depuis son départ de Paris, la semaine dernière, il vivait dans le tourbillon d'un kaléidoscope."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "8a857458-a332-4420-a89b-5240efacf447",
                                                "sense_id": "42be4533-c469-3501-b395-07c0277bd546",
                                                "text": "[…] la Lorraine est bel et bien un extraordinaire kaléidoscope modelé par l’histoire de ses migrations anciennes et récentes, aux identités complexes et aux cultures plurielles."
                                            }
                                        ]
